@* 🟢 قائمة متابعة طلبيات العملاء (نظام الطلبيات الحديث): تحلّ محل «عرض الطلبيات» (Request_To_Market، القائمة 560) و«بحث الطلبيات ذات
   المبالغ المدفوعة» (Request_With_Money، القائمة 561) بمعاملة ?paid=1 (فلتر «ذات مبالغ مدفوعة» مفعَّل مسبقاً).
   الإجراءات: فتح/تعديل الطلبية، تأكيد المسودة، إلغاء بسبب (لا حذف فعلى). التنفيذ (السحب فى فاتورة) والعربون فى مراحلهما. *@
@page "/accounts/sales/customer-orders"

@using System.Data
@using System.Globalization
@using AccountModelsLib
@using AccountModelsLib.Models
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Services
@inject LanguageService LangService
@inject ISnackbar Snackbar
@inject NavigationManager Nav
@implements IDisposable

<PageTitle>@Tr("COListTitle")</PageTitle>

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.False" Class="mt-4" Style="@($"direction: {(LangService.IsRtl ? "rtl" : "ltr")};")">

    <MudPaper Class="pa-4 mb-4" Elevation="1">
        <div class="d-flex align-center justify-space-between mb-4">
            <MudText Typo="Typo.h5" Color="Color.Primary" Class="font-weight-bold">@Tr("COListTitle")</MudText>
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Add"
                       OnClick="@(() => Nav.NavigateTo("/accounts/sales/customer-order"))">@Tr("COTitle")</MudButton>
        </div>
        <MudGrid Spacing="3">
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="3">
                <MudDatePicker T="DateTime?" @bind-Date="_from" Label="@Tr("DateFromLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" />
            </MudItem>
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="3">
                <MudDatePicker T="DateTime?" @bind-Date="_to" Label="@Tr("DateToLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" />
            </MudItem>
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="3">
                <MudTextField T="string" @bind-Value="_customerText" Label="@Tr("CustomerLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Clearable="true"
                              OnKeyDown="@(e => e.Key == "Enter" ? LoadAsync() : Task.CompletedTask)" />
            </MudItem>
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="6" md="3">
                <MudSelect T="int" @bind-Value="_status" Label="@Tr("COStatusFilter")" Variant="Variant.Outlined">
                    <MudSelectItem T="int" Value="-1">@Tr("COAllStatuses")</MudSelectItem>
                    @foreach (var s in Enum.GetValues<CustomerOrderStatus>())
                    {
                        <MudSelectItem T="int" Value="@((int)s)">@StatusText((int)s)</MudSelectItem>
                    }
                </MudSelect>
            </MudItem>
            <MudItem xs="12" md="9" Class="d-flex align-center" Style="gap:24px">
                <MudCheckBox T="bool" @bind-Value="_paidOnly" Label="@Tr("COPaidOnly")" Dense="true" />
                <MudCheckBox T="bool" @bind-Value="_overdueOnly" Label="@Tr("COOverdueOnly")" Dense="true" />
            </MudItem>
            <MudItem xs="12" md="3">
                <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Search" FullWidth="true"
                           OnClick="LoadAsync" Disabled="@_isLoading">@Tr("SearchButton")</MudButton>
            </MudItem>
        </MudGrid>
    </MudPaper>

    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_errorMessage))
    {
        <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Error" Dense="true" Class="mb-3">@_errorMessage</MudAlert>
    }

    @if (_cancelTarget is not null)
    {
        <MudPaper Class="pa-4 mb-4" Elevation="2">
            <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2">@Tr("COCancelOrderButton") #@_cancelTarget.Order_No</MudText>
            <MudTextField T="string" @bind-Value="_cancelReason" Label="@Tr("COCancelReasonLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Lines="2" Immediate="true" />
            <MudStack Row="true" Spacing="2" Class="mt-3">
                <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Error" Disabled="@(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_cancelReason) || _isBusy)" OnClick="ConfirmCancelAsync">@Tr("COCancelConfirm")</MudButton>
                <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" OnClick="@(() => _cancelTarget = null)">@Tr("Cancel")</MudButton>
            </MudStack>
        </MudPaper>
    }

    <MudTable Items="@_rows" T="OrderRow" Hover="true" Striped="true" Bordered="true" Dense="true" Elevation="1" Loading="@_isLoading"
              RowClassFunc="@((OrderRow row, int index) => row.Id == _selectedId ? "mud-selected-item" : string.Empty)"
              OnRowClick="@((TableRowClickEventArgs<OrderRow> e) => _selectedId = e.Item.Id)">
        <HeaderContent>
            <MudTh>#</MudTh>
            <MudTh>@Tr("DateColumn")</MudTh>
            <MudTh>@Tr("CustomerLabel")</MudTh>
            <MudTh>@Tr("COExpectedDateLabel")</MudTh>
            <MudTh>@Tr("COStatusFilter")</MudTh>
            <MudTh Style="text-align:end">@Tr("NetTotalColumn")</MudTh>
            <MudTh Style="text-align:end">@Tr("COPaidColumn")</MudTh>
            <MudTh>@Tr("COFulfilledColumn")</MudTh>
            <MudTh></MudTh>
        </HeaderContent>
        <RowTemplate>
            <MudTd DataLabel="#">@context.Order_No</MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("DateColumn")">@context.Date.ToString("yyyy/MM/dd", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)</MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("CustomerLabel")">@context.Customer</MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("COExpectedDateLabel")">
                @(context.Expected?.ToString("yyyy/MM/dd", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture) ?? "")
                @if (context.IsOverdue)
                {
                    <MudChip T="string" Size="Size.Small" Color="Color.Error" Variant="Variant.Outlined">@Tr("COOverdueOnly")</MudChip>
                }
            </MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("COStatusFilter")">
                <MudChip T="string" Size="Size.Small" Color="@StatusColor(context.Status)" Variant="Variant.Filled">@StatusText(context.Status)</MudChip>
            </MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("NetTotalColumn")" Style="text-align:end">@context.Net.ToString("N2")</MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("COPaidColumn")" Style="text-align:end">@context.Deposits.ToString("N2")</MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("COFulfilledColumn")" Style="min-width:120px">
                <MudProgressLinear Value="@context.Progress" Color="Color.Success" Size="Size.Medium" />
                <small>@context.QtyFulfilled.ToString("0.##") / @context.QtyTotal.ToString("0.##")</small>
            </MudTd>
            <MudTd Style="white-space:nowrap">
                <MudIconButton Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.EditNote" Size="Size.Medium" OnClick="@(() => Nav.NavigateTo($"/accounts/sales/customer-order/{context.Id}"))" aria-label="@Tr("COOpenButton")" />
                @if (context.Status == (int)CustomerOrderStatus.Confirmed || context.Status == (int)CustomerOrderStatus.PartiallyFulfilled)
                {
                    @* يفتح الطلبية على لوحة التنفيذ (الكميات المتبقية + نوع الفاتورة) ومنها تُفتح فاتورة المبيعات معبّأة. *@
                    <MudIconButton Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.ReceiptLong" Size="Size.Medium" Color="Color.Primary"
                                   OnClick="@(() => Nav.NavigateTo($"/accounts/sales/customer-order/{context.Id}"))" aria-label="@Tr("COConvertButton")" title="@Tr("COConvertButton")" />
                }
                @if (context.Status == (int)CustomerOrderStatus.Draft)
                {
                    <MudIconButton Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.CheckCircle" Size="Size.Medium" Color="Color.Success" Disabled="_isBusy" OnClick="@(() => ConfirmAsync(context))" aria-label="@Tr("COConfirmButton")" />
                }
                @if (context.Status == (int)CustomerOrderStatus.Draft || context.Status == (int)CustomerOrderStatus.Confirmed)
                {
                    <MudIconButton Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Cancel" Size="Size.Medium" Color="Color.Error" Disabled="_isBusy" OnClick="@(() => StartCancel(context))" aria-label="@Tr("COCancelOrderButton")" />
                }
            </MudTd>
        </RowTemplate>
        <NoRecordsContent>
            <MudText Align="Align.Center" Class="py-4 mud-text-secondary">@Tr("NoRecordsFound")</MudText>
        </NoRecordsContent>
    </MudTable>
</MudContainer>

@code {
    private record OrderRow(long Id, long Order_No, DateTime Date, DateTime? Expected, string Customer, int Status, decimal Net, decimal Deposits,
                            decimal QtyTotal, decimal QtyFulfilled)
    {
        public bool IsOverdue => Expected.HasValue && Expected.Value.Date < DateTime.Now.Date
            && (Status == (int)CustomerOrderStatus.Confirmed || Status == (int)CustomerOrderStatus.PartiallyFulfilled);
        public double Progress => QtyTotal <= 0 ? 0 : (double)Math.Min(100m, QtyFulfilled * 100m / QtyTotal);
    }

    [SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = "paid")] public int? PaidQuery { get; set; }

    private readonly CustomerOrdersService _service = new();
    private List<OrderRow> _rows = new();
    private DateTime? _from = DateTime.Now.Date.AddMonths(-3);
    private DateTime? _to = DateTime.Now.Date.AddMonths(1);
    private string? _customerText;
    private int _status = -1;
    private bool _paidOnly;
    private bool _overdueOnly;
    private long? _selectedId;
    private bool _isLoading;
    private bool _isBusy;
    private string? _errorMessage;
    private OrderRow? _cancelTarget;
    private string? _cancelReason;

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        LangService.OnLanguageChanged += OnLanguageChangedHandler;
        _paidOnly = PaidQuery == 1;
        await LoadAsync();
    }

    private void OnLanguageChangedHandler() => InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
    public void Dispose() => LangService.OnLanguageChanged -= OnLanguageChangedHandler;

    private async Task LoadAsync()
    {
        _errorMessage = null;
        _isLoading = true;
        StateHasChanged();
        var from = (_from ?? DateTime.Now.Date.AddMonths(-3)).Date;
        var to = (_to ?? DateTime.Now.Date.AddMonths(1)).Date;
        var status = _status;
        var paid = _paidOnly;
        var overdue = _overdueOnly;
        var text = _customerText ?? "";
        try
        {
            var dt = await Task.Run(() =>
            {
                AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant();
                return _service.ListOrders(from, to, 0, status, paid, overdue, text);
            });
            _rows = dt.Rows.Cast<DataRow>().Select(r => new OrderRow(
                Convert.ToInt64(r["Id"]),
                r["Order_No"] == DBNull.Value ? 0 : Convert.ToInt64(r["Order_No"]),
                Convert.ToDateTime(r["Order_Date"]),
                r["Expected_Delivery_Date"] == DBNull.Value ? null : Convert.ToDateTime(r["Expected_Delivery_Date"]),
                r["Customer_Name"]?.ToString()?.Trim() ?? "",
                r["Status"] == DBNull.Value ? 0 : Convert.ToInt32(r["Status"]),
                Convert.ToDecimal(r["Net_Total"]),
                Convert.ToDecimal(r["Deposits"]),
                Convert.ToDecimal(r["Qty_Total"]),
                Convert.ToDecimal(r["Qty_Fulfilled"]))).ToList();
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            _errorMessage = Tr("SystemError", ex.Message);
        }
        finally
        {
            _isLoading = false;
        }
    }

    private async Task ConfirmAsync(OrderRow row)
    {
        _isBusy = true;
        try
        {
            await Task.Run(() => { AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant(); _service.Confirm(row.Id); });
            Snackbar.Add(Tr("COConfirmedMsg", row.Order_No), Severity.Success);
            await LoadAsync();
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _errorMessage = Tr("SystemError", ex.Message); }
        finally { _isBusy = false; }
    }

    // 🟢 صلاحية إلغاء الطلبية (983) فى جدول صلاحيات القوائم؛ المدير يمر دائماً.
    private bool _canCancelOrder = true;
    private void StartCancel(OrderRow row)
    {
        _canCancelOrder = Common.IsHavePermissionSysMenu(Common.User_Id, 983, 2, -1);
        if (!_canCancelOrder) { Snackbar.Add(Tr("CONoCancelPermission"), Severity.Warning); return; }
        _cancelTarget = row; _cancelReason = "";
    }

    private async Task ConfirmCancelAsync()
    {
        if (_cancelTarget is null) return;
        var target = _cancelTarget;
        var reason = _cancelReason ?? "";
        _isBusy = true;
        try
        {
            await Task.Run(() => { AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant(); _service.Cancel(target.Id, reason); });
            Snackbar.Add(Tr("COCancelledMsg", target.Order_No), Severity.Success);
            _cancelTarget = null;
            await LoadAsync();
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _errorMessage = Tr("SystemError", ex.Message); }
        finally { _isBusy = false; }
    }

    private Color StatusColor(int s) => (CustomerOrderStatus)s switch
    {
        CustomerOrderStatus.Confirmed => Color.Primary,
        CustomerOrderStatus.PartiallyFulfilled => Color.Warning,
        CustomerOrderStatus.Fulfilled => Color.Success,
        CustomerOrderStatus.Cancelled => Color.Error,
        _ => Color.Default
    };

    private string StatusText(int s) => (CustomerOrderStatus)s switch
    {
        CustomerOrderStatus.Confirmed => Tr("COStatusConfirmed"),
        CustomerOrderStatus.PartiallyFulfilled => Tr("COStatusPartial"),
        CustomerOrderStatus.Fulfilled => Tr("COStatusFulfilled"),
        CustomerOrderStatus.Cancelled => Tr("COStatusCancelled"),
        CustomerOrderStatus.Closed => Tr("COStatusClosed"),
        _ => Tr("COStatusDraft")
    };

    private string Tr(string key, params object[] args)
    {
        var previousCulture = CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture;
        try
        {
            CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = LangService.CurrentCultureInfo;
            return Lang[key, args];
        }
        finally
        {
            CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = previousCulture;
        }
    }
}
